    {
      "id": 375158,
      "username": "ankush",
      "name": "Ankush Menat",
      "created_at": "2023-09-06T12:37:11.096Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Set the default as <code>+91-</code> from the customize form.</p>\n<p>It’s not an officially supported feature but it works because phone number fields just store the number as <code>+{countrycode}-{phonenumber}</code></p>\n<p>This however will validation failure, so you should write some script to remove it before save in case phone number is not specified. It will be fairly simple:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-python\">if doc.phone_number == \"+91-\":\n    doc.phone_number = \"\"\n</code></pre>\n<p>Alternatively, do both setting default and clearing from client script.</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/ankush/{size}/91407_2.png",
      "trust_level": 4,
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
