      "created_at": "2024-07-22T11:40:06.943Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"rioshaz\" data-post=\"5\" data-topic=\"109527\" data-full=\"true\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/rioshaz/48/37517_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> rioshaz:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>can u pls show how u did it ? as far as i know phone field is just to enter no… we cant add list of country code to select from , or can we ?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Under “Customize Form”, you can set the default value for various field.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/3/f3f21efba6670b126e9c467645dc2cc9ffdd8115.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/f3f21efba6670b126e9c467645dc2cc9ffdd8115\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/3/f3f21efba6670b126e9c467645dc2cc9ffdd8115_2_242x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"yO2LzdSBU4QwKkeclVSM0p430t7\" width=\"242\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/3/f3f21efba6670b126e9c467645dc2cc9ffdd8115_2_242x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/3/f3f21efba6670b126e9c467645dc2cc9ffdd8115_2_363x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/3/f3f21efba6670b126e9c467645dc2cc9ffdd8115.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"201E1D\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">398×820 21.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
