      "created_at": "2024-11-22T05:32:02.228Z",
      "cooked": "<p>To keep 91 as default in phone field<br>\nSet  +91-  in default option<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/7/870819d9d1a4bfeb0003c46279242efd236a6893.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/870819d9d1a4bfeb0003c46279242efd236a6893\" title=\"Screenshot from 2024-11-22 11-00-47\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/7/870819d9d1a4bfeb0003c46279242efd236a6893_2_208x500.png\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2024-11-22 11-00-47\" data-base62-sha1=\"jgxOw0TjjuSVaU8MTozEEbHVUOf\" width=\"208\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/7/870819d9d1a4bfeb0003c46279242efd236a6893_2_208x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/7/870819d9d1a4bfeb0003c46279242efd236a6893.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/7/870819d9d1a4bfeb0003c46279242efd236a6893.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F7F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot from 2024-11-22 11-00-47</span><span class=\"informations\">258×618 11.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
